  "key_findings": "K913 examines VRP (Variance Risk Premium = Implied - Realized Variance) as a return predictor for SPY. VRP is positive 85.7% of time (fear premium). Daily regression: beta=0.01373, t=1.095, R\u00b2=0.002600. Monthly regression: beta=0.02500, t=0.226, R\u00b2=0.000534. OOS R\u00b2 daily=-0.030911543936486874, monthly=-0.09906917297188511. VRP quintile Q5-Q1 spread: 0.2095 ann (t=1.121). VRP strategy Sharpe 0.5550 vs BH 0.4895. VRP provides return prediction info that VIX alone does not (VIX predicts vol magnitude, VRP captures fear premium = expected compensation for bearing vol risk).",
